  # that the shipped ungated /v1/tools is unchanged.
  #
  # TestAToolRevisionTimeout* and TestEveryToolRegistryCreate* are the two tool-registry CONTRACT defects,
  # and they need TWO MORE OWN ALTERNATIVES for the fifth and sixth time this list has made that discovery:
  # not one word already on this line is a substring of either name. The first pins that an out-of-range
