  # sibling project's ledger rows are not summed into this session's tokens — the narrowing RLS
  # deliberately does not do for usage_ledger — and that a session which never ran has no span rather
  # than a zero one. One holds the keyset order total across a microsecond clock tie by paging over
  # it. One holds the rename to being a LABEL: two sessions may carry the same name, and a foreign id
  # is a miss that writes nothing.
