  # WithA2A Admitter (NewA2AServer's a2aRuns over store.Store) births a genuine run under the auth scope
  # and resolves through the real GetResponse — the real-Admitter admission the review requires. The E19
  # Task 1 Slack Events route joins it: the SHIPPED POST /v1/slack/events, over the production router and
  # the same real Admitter, against a fake Slack peer built to the published contract (one run per source
  # event through a retry storm, one session per thread, bot-self births nothing, and a rejected delivery
  # writes nothing at all).
